{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/chroma_1731998291596.png?t=1745318569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">is an FPS game that races over a western train and takes on a gang eroded by an unknown presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run over the western train!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/Run.gif?t=1745318569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a Western-era outlaw, deal with a gang that's occupying the train.<br>Will you be able to get to the end of the train safely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take away the enemy's weapons!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/steal_1723864174983.gif?t=1745318569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly bring the weapon that the enemy drops with the chain.<br>The weapon you brought is free to use!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/shootgun.gif?t=1745318569\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/yunsa.gif?t=1745318569\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444010/extras/sochong.gif?t=1745318569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try a total of seven distinctive weapons.<br>You'll be able to run the train more easily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face the unknown!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=